      "writtenOn": "2025-09-29T08:52:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, actually in this very example in pkvm_vcpu_after_set_cpuid(), we need to write `size` to this memory, after clearing it but before undonating it? (We shouldn\u0027t do that _after_ undonating it, i.e. when it may be already potentially donated to a pVM and so on.)",
      "parentUuid": "7a6e28d7_10d1c9d6",
      "revId": "5871a97a10b053c572926f854e77bf3427abfe57",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
